    "implementation_delta": "Add LiveLocalFilesystemAdapter@1 and LocalBackendQualification@1. The live local POSIX store persists CID sidecars, fsyncs publications, reopens after process close, detects corruption, honors deadlines/cancellation, rejects secret material, and serializes concurrent mutations. HermeticFilesystemAdapter remains labeled not-live and cannot mint live qualification. Python write/read-back/digest/delete/replay/timeout/concurrency/restart/corruption/large-object/credential cases were live-observed. CLI/MCP/MCP++ local-durable sessions stay typed unavailable (PCPR-026). Pinned IPFS stays typed unavailable (PCPR-021). Public README production-ready language is replaced with R&D non-promoted status. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
